          "pWrong": 0.41
        },
        {
          "id": "middle:Katarina:Viktor:4",
          "text": "Use Death Lotus once Viktor has used his stun. Stay close, since it needs an enemy champion nearby, and Arcane Storm's first hit can disrupt you.",
          "refs": [
